@startuml openSourceLibraryInterface
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members

class "zlib" as OSS <<component>> #LightGrey {
  .. provides ..
  +deflateInit()
  +deflate()
  +deflateEnd()
  +inflateInit()
  +inflate()
  +inflateEnd()
  .. requires ..
  -malloc()
  -free()
}

legend right
  |= Section |= Meaning |
  | provides (+) | Interface offered by the component |
  | requires (-) | Interface the component needs from the system |
endlegend
@enduml
